{"type":"message","id":"2da65aca","parentId":"2e50729b","timestamp":"2026-03-24T23:47:08.060Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_HkaQcMB3YfbvJS4bkkvxzUa8|fc_0075cc9dd90c76520169c3227bedfc8191b20727d6a54fe066","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"uditgoenka/autoresearch\tClaude Autoresearch Skill — Autonomous goal-directed iteration for Claude Code. Inspired by Karpathy's autoresearch. Modify → Verify → Keep/Discard → Repeat forever.\tpublic\t2026-03-24T23:38:10Z\ntrevin-creator/autoresearch-mlx\tApple Silicon (MLX) port of Karpathy's autoresearch — autonomous AI research loops on Mac, no PyTorch required.\tpublic\t2026-03-24T23:35:10Z\nchrisworsey55/atlas-gic\tATLAS by General Intelligence Capital — Self-improving AI trading agents using Karpathy-style autoresearch\tpublic\t2026-03-24T21:58:12Z\nalvinunreal/awesome-autoresearch\tA curated list of autonomous improvement loops, research agents, and autoresearch-style systems inspired by Karpathy's autoresearch.\tpublic\t2026-03-24T23:37:56Z\nleo-lilinxiao/codex-autoresearch\tCodex Autoresearch Skill — A self-directed iterative system for Codex that continuously cycles through: modify, verify, retain or discard, and repeat indefinitely. Inspired by Karpathy’s autoresearch concept.\tpublic\t2026-03-24T23:29:07Z\ntopherchris420/james_library\tLocal AI agents doing physics and research semi-autonomously🐙predates Karpathy's AutoResearch\tpublic\t2026-03-24T20:23:36Z\nArchishmanSengupta/autovoiceevals\tA self-improving loop for voice AI agents. Uses karpathy's autoresearch as foundation.\tpublic\t2026-03-24T22:22:51Z\nliviaellen/autoresearch-gen\tScaffold generator for Karpathy's autoresearch. PT + MLX, any LLM, Streamlit dashboard.\tpublic\t2026-03-23T09:17:31Z\niii-hq/n-autoresearch\tAutonomous ML research infrastructure for autoresearch by Karpathy. Multi-GPU parallelism, structured experiment tracking, adaptive search strategy.\tpublic\t2026-03-24T19:48:01Z\nexecuteautomation/autoresearch_